  "policy": "SOURCE=0 admission observations only, not reset-history proof. Exclude H24 and RO WINDOW. Require mandatory ISR=0 without clearing events. Preserve PSC, DATE, TIME, AWTARR, alarms and timestamp values. Never write KEY, ACCESS, ICR or controls during admission.",
